  "_note": "n=7 multi-scenario run. Schedule: ProposalDelay, NetworkDelay, NetworkDelayFCrash, Throttle, ProposalDelay, NetworkDelay, NetworkDelayFCrash, Throttle, Healthy (cycles after Healthy). ProposalDelay delays nodes 1,2; NetworkDelay is 170 ms on every pair; NetworkDelayFCrash adds nodes 3,5 crashed (Election draws from live nodes only there); Throttle: client gates the leader to 1 batch/100 ms after a 3 s prep, k=2, strategy from the leader policy. Fixed/Perf floor 150 ms in NetworkDelay/NetworkDelayFCrash, 350 ms elsewhere. Epoch grid on, so Adaptive and the baselines switch scenario on the same grid lines (docs/epoch-grid.md); a full cycle is 9 x 7500 s = 18 h 45 m. Client offers 200 tx per 24 ms (8,333 tx/s); period x number_of_periods = 600M tx, ~20 h. BASELINE PeriodicElection, NATIVE: one generation per scenario (scenario_generations 1, epoch_timer_ms 7,500,000 = 100 x 75 s), oracle returns the same action, so the only generation switches are the scenario changes, on Adaptive's grid lines.",
